# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — tree-methanogens
# ==============================================================================
# Strategy: Track code, figures, and directory structure.
# Data file *contents* are archived on Zenodo; only .gitkeep files are tracked
# to preserve the directory layout for reproducibility.
# ==============================================================================

# --- R project files ---
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Claude Code ---
.claude/

# --- Manuscript files (not for public repos) ---
manuscript/
*.docx
*.tex
REVISED_*.md
REFERENCE_*.md
supporting_information.md
references.bib
doi_list.txt
outputs/figure_captions.md
# Revision prose/notes (manuscript-adjacent; not for public repo)
code/revision/notes/

# --- Data (all archived on Zenodo; git tracks ONLY the folder structure) ---
# Every data file lives in the Zenodo archive and drops into data/ locally.
# Git keeps only .gitkeep so the directory layout (and all paths) are pre-wired.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

# --- Outputs (regenerable via the pipeline; git tracks ONLY the folder structure
#     and the assembled numbered manuscript figure set) ---
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/**/.gitkeep
# The ASSEMBLED numbered manuscript set only -- the figures a reader should get
# from a clone. Was !outputs/revision/figures/** until the outputs reorg moved
# these out of outputs/revision/; without updating it the whole tracked figure
# set silently became ignored and would have been dropped from the public repo.
# NOT included, deliberately: figures/generated (raw generator output),
# figures/legacy (original-pipeline intermediates) and figures/qc (diagnostics)
# are all regenerable and none are cited.
!outputs/figures/main/**
!outputs/figures/SI/**
!outputs/figures/photos/**
!outputs/figures/tables/**
!outputs/figures/MANIFEST.md

# --- Deprecated directory (old code/data, not tracked) ---
deprecated/

# --- Temporary/auto-generated files ---
Rplots.pdf
*.Rplots.pdf

# goFlux import intermediates (regenerable; see rescue workflow)
RData/
